      "input": {
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-20T08:46:06.145624Z",
        "description": "Camunda and Flowable both filled the slot, but only one has a licence a sovereignty-constrained buyer cannot accept \u2014 which is what separates a wedge from a dead end."
